**Angled** | Attribute
__Basics__
An attribute used by the angle to mark players who are lynch protected

__Formalized__
On Poll `Lynch` Win:
  • Set Counter to @Voters->Count
  • For Each @OtherVoters:
    ‣ @ThisAttr->Source is @Ind: Decrement Counter
  • @Self->Counter > 0:
    ‣ Protect @Target from `Lynches` through Passive Defense (~UntilUse)
    ‣ Emit `Target Saved` for @ThisAttr->Source
